    "detailed_description": "\ud83d\udd25 LUST Eternal \ud83d\udd1e \u2014 a hellish, fast-paced shooter where brutal carnage and sinful pleasures collide in an infernal dance of chaos. You\u2019re not a victim. You\u2019re the huntress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/a4f091f53972b83360728bf3cc3f0446.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/a4f091f53972b83360728bf3cc3f0446.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/a4f091f53972b83360728bf3cc3f0446.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 STORY</h2>You are a sinner, wandering through the burning wastelands of hell, hiding from the horrors that lurk in the shadows. Starving, desperate\u2026 until you stumble upon the corpse of a fallen warrior. A powerful weapon lies beside him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/7a244c712fccf6ce3a3357d20e08ad21.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/7a244c712fccf6ce3a3357d20e08ad21.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/7a244c712fccf6ce3a3357d20e08ad21.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hunger takes over. As you devour his brain, flashes of his memories ignite inside you\u2014visions of slaughter, of demons torn apart by his hands. The last bite seals your fate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/c02fe028767bf239640e437fa551efce.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/c02fe028767bf239640e437fa551efce.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/c02fe028767bf239640e437fa551efce.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With a shotgun in hand, you rise from the ashes, let out a bloodcurdling scream\u2014&quot;AAAAAHHHH!&quot;\u2014and unleash absolute carnage upon the underworld.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/85bfa02551f188683d6f35af23dede20.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/85bfa02551f188683d6f35af23dede20.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/85bfa02551f188683d6f35af23dede20.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The deeper you go, the stronger your enemies become. But the greater the challenge, the sweeter the reward\u2014defeat Hell\u2019s guardians, and indulge in sinful pleasures with the most tempting succubi and demons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/38541aeeb31849b06fe66bb807921605.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/38541aeeb31849b06fe66bb807921605.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/38541aeeb31849b06fe66bb807921605.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 GAMEPLAY FEATURES</h2>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fast-paced, brutal combat</strong> \u2013 run, shoot, tear through your enemies, leave nothing but blood and ashes.<br>\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Savage Abilities</strong> \u2013 unleash kinetic strikes, explosive mines, berserk rage, and super jumps to crush enemies with brutal force.<br>\ud83d\udc7f <strong>Seductive rewards </strong>\u2013 prove your dominance, and Hell\u2019s most alluring creatures will be yours to enjoy.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>An arsenal of destruction</strong> \u2013 buy  and upgrade weapons, experiment with different playstyles.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 crush Hell\u2019s guardians and fight your way deeper into chaos and temptation.<br><br><strong><u>\ud83d\udda4 Hell is yours to conquer. Will you burn it to the ground or revel in its sinful delights?</u></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "\ud83d\udd25 LUST Eternal \ud83d\udd1e \u2014 a hellish, fast-paced shooter where brutal carnage and sinful pleasures collide in an infernal dance of chaos. You\u2019re not a victim. You\u2019re the huntress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/a4f091f53972b83360728bf3cc3f0446.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/a4f091f53972b83360728bf3cc3f0446.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/a4f091f53972b83360728bf3cc3f0446.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 STORY</h2>You are a sinner, wandering through the burning wastelands of hell, hiding from the horrors that lurk in the shadows. Starving, desperate\u2026 until you stumble upon the corpse of a fallen warrior. A powerful weapon lies beside him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/7a244c712fccf6ce3a3357d20e08ad21.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/7a244c712fccf6ce3a3357d20e08ad21.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/7a244c712fccf6ce3a3357d20e08ad21.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hunger takes over. As you devour his brain, flashes of his memories ignite inside you\u2014visions of slaughter, of demons torn apart by his hands. The last bite seals your fate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/c02fe028767bf239640e437fa551efce.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/c02fe028767bf239640e437fa551efce.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/c02fe028767bf239640e437fa551efce.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With a shotgun in hand, you rise from the ashes, let out a bloodcurdling scream\u2014&quot;AAAAAHHHH!&quot;\u2014and unleash absolute carnage upon the underworld.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/85bfa02551f188683d6f35af23dede20.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/85bfa02551f188683d6f35af23dede20.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/85bfa02551f188683d6f35af23dede20.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The deeper you go, the stronger your enemies become. But the greater the challenge, the sweeter the reward\u2014defeat Hell\u2019s guardians, and indulge in sinful pleasures with the most tempting succubi and demons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/38541aeeb31849b06fe66bb807921605.poster.avif?t=1747994377\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/38541aeeb31849b06fe66bb807921605.webm?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/38541aeeb31849b06fe66bb807921605.mp4?t=1747994377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 GAMEPLAY FEATURES</h2>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fast-paced, brutal combat</strong> \u2013 run, shoot, tear through your enemies, leave nothing but blood and ashes.<br>\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Savage Abilities</strong> \u2013 unleash kinetic strikes, explosive mines, berserk rage, and super jumps to crush enemies with brutal force.<br>\ud83d\udc7f <strong>Seductive rewards </strong>\u2013 prove your dominance, and Hell\u2019s most alluring creatures will be yours to enjoy.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>An arsenal of destruction</strong> \u2013 buy  and upgrade weapons, experiment with different playstyles.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 crush Hell\u2019s guardians and fight your way deeper into chaos and temptation.<br><br><strong><u>\ud83d\udda4 Hell is yours to conquer. Will you burn it to the ground or revel in its sinful delights?</u></strong>",
    "short_description": "LUST Eternal \ud83d\udd1e \u2013 A brutal, fast-paced shooter where you rise from the ashes, armed with a shotgun and a thirst for carnage. Slaughter demons, crush Hell\u2019s guardians, and claim your sinful rewards with seductive succubi. Hell is yours\u2014will you conquer or indulge? \ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udd25",
